ment-90c0136 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"90c0136\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Book a Live Demo <\/h4>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b32f989 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b32f989\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Watch us optimise a slice of your product data in real time.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-37a8422 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"37a8422\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2076874 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2076874\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Step-2<\/h4>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3e1c385 elementor-view-stacked elementor-shape-rounded elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon\" data-id=\"3e1c385\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M56.3707 307.783C61.6673 310.504 67.2299 312.673 72.9707 314.255V344.255C72.9813 344.914 73.0864 345.569 73.2827 346.199C73.823 351.097 75.6024 355.776 78.4529 359.795C81.3034 363.814 85.1311 367.041 89.5747 369.171C141.784 393.178 198.535 405.707 255.999 405.915C313.463 405.707 370.213 393.178 422.423 369.171C42